# Garnet, Princess of Alexandria: "Whenever Garnet attacks, you may remove a lore counter from each of any number of Sagas you
# control. Put a +1/+1 counter on Garnet for each lore counter removed this way." Bot1 controls two Songs of Freyalise on
# turn 3: the first with 2 lore counters (chapter II has just triggered), the second with 1. Garnet attacks; Bot1 chooses
# both Sagas, so one counter comes off each (the first to 1, the second to 0) and Garnet gets two +1/+1 counters: a 4/4
# lifelinker that deals 4 damage, so Bot2 is at 16 and Bot1 gains 4. The Sagas keep the counters left (1 and 0): removing lore
# counters triggers no chapter (CR 714.2b) and a Saga with fewer than its last chapter's number stays (CR 714.4).

